# Interface contract / OpenCode (project)

**Before any action**, load the Contract `.agents/AGENTS.md`.

---

_This file is loaded natively by OpenCode at startup (`AGENTS.md` at the project root, no custom hook needed). It stacks with the Home stub `~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md` (both are loaded, no replacement — unlike Claude Code/Gemini CLI, where a project-scope hook replaces the Home hook)._

_For any improvement to this contract, update the reference source in `.agents/AGENTS.md`. Do not add anything here except what is strictly specific to OpenCode on this project._
